<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH RPIX RISES AT MID-SESSION,KOMERCNI,SPT SURGE.</title>
<headline>CZECH RPIX RISES AT MID-SESSION,KOMERCNI,SPT SURGE.</headline>
<text>
<p>1045 GMT - The Czech RPIX rises at mid-session on Wednesday</p>
<p>with Komercni Banka and SPT Telecom </p>
<p>continuing to post strong gains.</p>
<p>*  Reuters RPIX index rises 19.8 points, 1.84 percent, to 1,098.7.</p>
<p>* Turnover, 11.2 million crowns.</p>
<p>* Komercni rises, 108 crowns, 6.0 percent, to 1,895.</p>
<p>* SPT Telecom rises 110 crowns, 2.7 percent, to all time</p>
<p>high of 4,150.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
